{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 2510,
    "dDurationMs": 3809,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Suppose you drop a ball down the side of a\nvalley - classical wisdom tells us that when"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6319,
    "dDurationMs": 3481,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the ball rolls up the hill on the other side,\nit can't go any higher than the height from"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 9800,
    "dDurationMs": 3270,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which you dropped it - that's conservation\nof energy!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 13070,
    "dDurationMs": 3400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Even if there's a nice big long slope to roll\ndown on the far side of the mountain, the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 16470,
    "dDurationMs": 3890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "ball just can't get there - unless you give\nit enough energy to get over the barrier."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 20360,
    "dDurationMs": 2490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But in quantum mechanics, things work a little\ndifferently."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 22850,
    "dDurationMs": 5180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You see, the quantum world is probabilistic,\nso if you release a particle in a valley,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 28030,
    "dDurationMs": 3450,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "chances are the next time you see it, it'll\nstill be somewhere in that valley."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 31480,
    "dDurationMs": 3800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But if there's a nice big slope to roll down\non the far side of the mountain…"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 35280,
    "dDurationMs": 3860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "well, that's a place the particle would really\nlike to be - and it turns out there's also"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 39140,
    "dDurationMs": 2430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a small chance that's where you'll find it!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 41570,
    "dDurationMs": 4159,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If this isn't crazy enough, it's even possible\nyou'll find the particle in the middle of"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 45729,
    "dDurationMs": 4621,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the mountain… and in real life this means\nthat an electron sometimes hangs around inside"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 50350,
    "dDurationMs": 12860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the nucleus of an atom!"
    } ]
  } ]
}
